  "page": 2,
  "citation": "Concurrently, Wen et al. (2026) introduce Priced Guidance to quantify the cost of steering a model"
 },
 {
  "id": "RS-10",
  "piece": "Re-Search, arXiv 2611.14487v1",
  "pdf": "docs/sources/pdf/organisme-re-search-v1/arxiv-2611.14487/2611.14487v1.pdf",
  "empreinte": "ae848c68e65c4a779d0df6725e4189ad80c351fe2e9402930be14db2ddfa7ccc",
  "page": 3,
  "citation": "consistent with our finding that weaker models can use supplied candidates they struggle to propose independently"
 },
 {
  "id": "RS-11",
  "piece": "Re-Search, arXiv 2611.14487v1",
  "pdf": "docs/sources/pdf/organisme-re-search-v1/arxiv-2611.14487/2611.14487v1.pdf",
  "empreinte": "ae848c68e65c4a779d0df6725e4189ad80c351fe2e9402930be14db2ddfa7ccc",
