  "page": 5,
  "citation": "In all games, Gemma-4-31B serves as the answerer, each inquisitor asks up to T = 100 questions, and we play three games per paper."
 },
 {
  "id": "RS-24",
  "piece": "Re-Search, arXiv 2611.14487v1",
  "pdf": "docs/sources/pdf/organisme-re-search-v1/arxiv-2611.14487/2611.14487v1.pdf",
  "empreinte": "ae848c68e65c4a779d0df6725e4189ad80c351fe2e9402930be14db2ddfa7ccc",
  "page": 5,
  "citation": "Gemma agrees most often with human labels on 795 annotated answers (94.0%, against 86.2% for GPT-OSS-120B and 78.4% for Qwen3.6-35B-A3B; see § D for details), and only 1.1% flip YES and NO"
 },
 {
  "id": "RS-25",
  "piece": "Re-Search, arXiv 2611.14487v1",
